\frac{\delta\rho_I}{\rho_I^{(0)}} \approx \xi^2 \frac{\operatorname{tr}\bigl[(\mathbf{I}+\mathbf{M})^{-1}\mathbf{S}\mathbf{Q}\mathbf{S}^\dagger\bigr]}{\log_2\det(\mathbf{I}+\mathbf{M})} \lesssim \xi^2 \approx 6\times 10^{-3},

